"First thought is, 'Are you guys idiots?'"

84
00:11:47,016 --> 00:11:50,816
「ラプラスといえば、『アイドル』みたいなもの」
"When it comes to Laplus, she's like an idol."

85
00:11:50,816 --> 00:11:56,016
「それはちょっとね 世間は許してくれませんよ」
"That's a bit... society won't stand for it."

86
00:12:22,216 --> 00:12:28,016
妄想生来のつくりましょ 君と合致あうの勝手
Let's fabricate a delusion from birth, matching with you as we please.

87
00:12:28,016 --> 00:12:32,816
かまってもっと足りないの 期待 思い出し満たし 嫉妬のスタイル
Pay attention to me, it's not enough! Expectations filling memories, jealous style.

88
00:12:32,816 --> 00:12:36,516
変わる 変わる 傷つけ合っては持たないって
Changing, changing, saying hurting each other won't last.

89
